[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3343420471","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110985#issuecomment-3343420471","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110985","id":3343420471,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HSIw3","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-28T13:43:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T13:43:56Z","body":"Polaris GPUs don't have FP16 support (which [4.5 onwards uses in the Mobile renderer when supported to improve performance](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107119)), so it seems some kind of feature detection isn't performed correctly.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3343420471/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3346907406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110985#issuecomment-3346907406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110985","id":3346907406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HfcEO","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T13:18:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T13:18:20Z","body":"We'll probably need OP's help with a debugging-enabled build to track down what is going on, because a short review of the involved code hasn't revealed anything to me. Stepping into this line and seeing what the variables involved have returned would help.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8d8041bd4dab30e51ecf5be21dc7bf1f6a26c039/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_mobile/scene_shader_forward_mobile.cpp#L559-L560\n\n- According to the GPU Info dumps I've looked at for this GPU, shaderFloat16 is reported as unsupported.\n- Vulkan driver makes an explicit check for this feature to even report that half floats are enabled, so it sounds like the GPU must be misreporting this value (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8d8041bd4dab30e51ecf5be21dc7bf1f6a26c039/drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp#L5912).\n- `GL_EXT_shader_explicit_arithmetic_types_float16` is only enabled if `EXPLICIT_FP16`, which should only correspond to that mobile renderer code and using it only if FP16 is supported.\n\nIf shaderFloat16 is reported as false, then the only other scenario I can think of is that there's an implementation error somehow in the mobile renderer when it comes to picking the right variant, which is not necessarily impossible given it involves some arithmetic to arrive to the right index. It'd be best if OP can confirm first whether shaderFloat16 is reported accurately though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3346907406/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3347414776","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110985#issuecomment-3347414776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110985","id":3347414776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HhX74","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T14:46:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T14:46:22Z","body":"Looks like GPUInfo reports that `shaderFloat16` is false for that GPU. \n\nAlso for newer drivers `VK_AMD_gpu_shader_half_float` is supported, but older drivers don't seem to support it\n\n@codec-xyz Can you download the GPU reporting tool from here: https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/download.php and then send us the report that it generates? ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3347414776/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349223942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110985#issuecomment-3349223942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110985","id":3349223942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HoRoG","user":{"login":"codec-xyz","id":112908328,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrrYKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112908328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz","html_url":"https://github.com/codec-xyz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/received_eve