needs to be requested and enabled manually in order to avoid the error. It seems it has been deprecated since 2019 though, so that might be a bit of a problem.\n\nDo you have any issues in addition to the error? Do things still draw correctly?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349540175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351641684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110985#issuecomment-3351641684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110985","id":3351641684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hxf5U","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T11:51:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T11:51:39Z","body":"I just noticed OP is also using Forward Plus, so it can't even be incorrectly going down the wrong path of using the FP16 variants like the mobile renderer as it doesn't have defines for it. Perhaps the error originates from FSR/FSR2 which have explicit support for this?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351641684/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353653720","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110985#issuecomment-3353653720","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110985","id":3353653720,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H5LHY","user":{"login":"codec-xyz","id":112908328,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrrYKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112908328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz","html_url":"https://github.com/codec-xyz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codec-xyz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T20:14:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T20:16:55Z","body":"As far as I can tell everything is working and draws correctly on my hardware.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3353653720/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1"